WEBVTT

00:05:59.767 --> 00:06:02.347
one of them might engage you
more than anything else,

00:06:02.371 --> 00:06:04.965
and then you may have found
your greatest love,

00:06:04.989 --> 00:06:09.180
in comparison to all the other things
that interest you,

00:06:09.204 --> 00:06:10.921
and that's what passion is.

00:06:10.945 --> 00:06:13.976
I have a friend, proposed to his sweetie.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.839
He was an economically rational person.

00:06:17.315 --> 00:06:19.909
He said to his sweetie, "Let us marry.

00:06:21.355 --> 00:06:23.601
Let us merge our interests."

00:06:23.625 --> 00:06:25.497
(Laughter)

00:06:25.521 --> 00:06:26.672
Yes, he did.

00:06:27.259 --> 00:06:30.990
"I love you truly," he said.
"I love you deeply.